   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Headline",
   "text": "Pump Anywhere, Hands Completely Free",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObJ9Yu/Headline"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "Pump Anywhere, Hands Completely Free | Wireless, Wearable, Whisper-Quiet | Built-In Warmth for Easier Letdown | The Wearable Pump That Keeps Up | No Cords. No Tubes. No Sitting Still | Fully wireless and wearable — pump while you work, drive, or hold your baby | Built-in warmth and massage to support a more comfortable session | Quiet enough for night sessions, calls, and sleeping babies | Wears right in your bra. No tubes, no cords, no setup | One pump for the kitchen, the car, the office, and the nursery",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObJ9Yu/Primary Text"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "修改建议",
   "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 静音表述改客观参数（as low as 48 dB），避免 whisper/silent/ultra-quiet 绝对化",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObJ9Yu/修改建议"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "命中原因",
   "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；M01 静音程度夸大（建议改为 low noise / quiet mode）",
